{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"日焼け止めを肌に染み込ませました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"危うくびちょびちょに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なるところでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は撮影でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなったけど、美雲！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美雲といっぱい話したいなあー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなあちゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なあちゃんのウェーブヘアーとカラー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃすきなんですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふあふあなんですよもう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なあちゃんお菓子食べるまりか爪噛む"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかは将来的に\n欲しい資格とか免許とかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"資格っていっぱいあるよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きものとか自然とか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"車の免許はいつか取りたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンケーキとホットケーキの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違いって何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パンケーキって\nパンなの？ケーキなの？(´・c_・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー一緒一緒！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"些細なことは気にしないない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の服の趣味合う子って誰？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラスメイト♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問が採用されるかどうかは、\n質問してから何更新くらいが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目安になりますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログコメント"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が読んでいるときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反映されたものから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピックアップしてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この夏に注目してる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイテム等はあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロンパースとかセットアップ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全員白コーデとか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりおは彼女がいたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何をしてあげるんじゃい？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"守ってあげる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近メンバーがblogにのっけてる\n右下にマークがついてる写真って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかのアプリなの？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"押したら拡大して画質良いよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていうマークだよたぶん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、サロペットと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花柄パンツとポーチ買いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サロペットは見た瞬間"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビビビッときました。かわいいのよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度載せるねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/05/25/9331152/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイク落とした顔。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイライン落ち切ってない顔。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日全員で撮影あるーうわーい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}